            "body": "> [@echasnovski](https://github.com/echasnovski) Hi! Is there a way to override _only_ the `j` and `k` mappings in mini.files?\n\nI am not sure I understand the question. Could you elaborate, please?\n\nIt is possible to disable automatic creation of buffer-local variables [by setting them to `''`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-files.txt#L585-L601) and create *any* buffer-local mappings [like this](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f6fe169821506a59b2407e3c7a3327562600e0e3/doc/mini-files.txt#L461-L468).",
